{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_md", "label": "notice-communication-package.md", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L1"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_alex_morgan_lawyer_review_edits", "label": "## Alex Morgan lawyer review edits", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2074"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_i_reviewed_this_draft_against_the_intake_facts_the_draft_must_not_imply_that_the_creditor_report_user_or_notice_issuer_is_known_the_bracketed_fields_are_mandatory_launch_inputs_not_optional_copy_edits_i_also_changed_the_operational_posture_the_real_time_message_is_an_interim_customer_explanation_and_the_written_notice_is_the_control_record_unless_legal_confirms_otherwise_for_a_specific_flow", "label": "I reviewed this draft against the intake facts. The draft must not imply that the creditor, report user, or notice issuer is known. The bracketed fields are mandatory launch inputs, not optional copy edits. I also changed the operational posture: the real-time message is an interim customer explanation, and the written notice is the control record unless Legal confirms otherwise for a specific flow.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2076"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_before_approval_product_must_provide_one_completed_row_for_each_product_state_decision_maker_report_user_and_outcome_legal_must_approve_the_reason_code_mapping_and_verify_the_current_regulation_b_fcra_esign_and_state_requirements_operations_must_prove_that_the_notice_is_generated_even_when_the_customer_abandons_after_a_decision_and_that_support_sees_the_same_approved_reason_family", "label": "Before approval, Product must provide one completed row for each product, state, decision-maker, report user, and outcome. Legal must approve the reason-code mapping and verify the current Regulation B, FCRA, ESIGN, and state requirements. Operations must prove that the notice is generated even when the customer abandons after a decision, and that support sees the same approved reason family.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2078"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_the_recommendation_remains_separate_from_any_recorded_decision_it_is_acceptable_to_proceed_to_limited_implementation_planning_with_placeholders_it_is_not_acceptable_to_enable_a_customer_facing_decline_path_with_a_missing_issuer_missing_principal_reason_unproven_electronic_consent_basis_or_an_unresolved_counteroffer_classification_notice_and_customer_communication_package_real_time_decision_flow", "label": "The recommendation remains separate from any recorded decision. It is acceptable to proceed to limited implementation planning with placeholders. It is not acceptable to enable a customer-facing decline path with a missing issuer, missing principal reason, unproven electronic-consent basis, or an unresolved counteroffer classification.Notice and Customer-Communication Package \u2014 Real-Time Decision Flow", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2080"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_1_per_flow_notice_matrix", "label": "1. Per-Flow Notice Matrix", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2087"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_2_application_status_classification", "label": "2. Application Status Classification", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2106"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_3_principal_reason_handling", "label": "3. Principal-Reason Handling", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2119"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_matters_northstar_ux_test_04_adverse_action_notices_for_declined_applica_dfe958_notice_communication_package_4_fcra_report_user_fields_written_notice_when_a_consumer_report_is_used", "label": "4. FCRA Report-User Fields (written notice, when a consumer report is used)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/03_Matters/northstar-ux-test-04-adverse-action-notices-for-declined-applica-dfe958/notice-communication-package.md", "source_location": "L2135"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_vault_03_ma